.TH "cursesdemo-by-dc5" "6" "2026-11-13" "Curses Demo User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
cursesdemo-by-dc5 - run Curses Demo, a text-mode demo released by DC5
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
cursesdemo-by-dc5 [\f[B]--no-music\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Curses Demo is a one-minute demo written in C with ncurses by tfinn of
The Dennis Courtney 5 (DC5).
It was released in August 2003 and ranked 3rd in the combined demo compo
of Pilgrimage 2003.
.PP
Bouncing \[lq]DC5\[rq] letters, sine scrollers, a little man made of
ASCII characters who plays yo-yo and an expanding star field.
The demo uses the whole terminal, whatever its size, and prints a short
message when it ends.
.PP
The soundtrack, Patchbay by Octothorp, is played with
\f[B]mpg123\f[R](1) from
\f[I]/usr/share/cursesdemo-by-dc5/patchbay.mp3\f[R].
If mpg123 is not installed, the demo runs silently.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]--no-music\f[R]
do not play the soundtrack.
.SH KEYS
.TP
\f[B]Ctrl+C\f[R]
stop the demo.
.SH FILES
.TP
\f[I]/usr/share/cursesdemo-by-dc5/patchbay.mp3\f[R]
the soundtrack.
.SH INFOS
.PP
https://www.pouet.net/prod.php?which=10644
.SH BUGS
.PP
No known bugs.
